E) PROCFS STATS (/proc/kobjx_stats)
================================================================================

WHAT IT DOES:
----------------------------------------
Exposes kernel internal metrics to user space.

FLOW:
----------------------------------------
1. User reads:
      cat /proc/kobjx_stats

2. Kernel executes seq_file handler

3. Prints:
      - active objects
      - alloc count
      - free count

WHAT IT SIMULATES IN REAL KERNEL:
----------------------------------------
✔ /proc/slabinfo
✔ /proc/meminfo
✔ /proc/vmstat

ADDITIONAL TECH INSIGHT:
----------------------------------------
- seq_file avoids buffer overflow
- safe for large kernel output
- zero-copy style streaming output

