F) PER-CPU STATISTICS (cpu_stats)
================================================================================

WHAT IT DOES:
----------------------------------------
Tracks allocations/frees per CPU to avoid contention.

FLOW:
----------------------------------------
1. Each CPU updates its own counter:
      this_cpu_inc()

2. No locking required

WHAT IT SIMULATES IN REAL KERNEL:
----------------------------------------
✔ scheduler stats
✔ SLUB per-cpu freelist stats
✔ network packet counters

ADDITIONAL TECH INSIGHT:
----------------------------------------
- avoids spinlock overhead
- improves scalability on SMP systems
- core design used in SLUB allocator

