================================================================================
7) RCU (READ-COPY-UPDATE)
================================================================================

WHAT IT DOES:
----------------------------------------
Allows safe deletion without locking readers.

FLOW:
----------------------------------------
1. Readers:
      rcu_read_lock()

2. Writers:
      remove object

3. Defer free:
      call_rcu()

4. After grace period:
      memory freed

REAL USE:
----------------------------------------
✔ network routing tables
✔ filesystem metadata
✔ scheduler data structures

TECH INSIGHT:
----------------------------------------
- extremely scalable read-heavy design
- used in high-performance kernel paths

